# Default tags for the Collect Images workflow.
#
# Fill in a tag per repo, then run `make sync-defaults` to bake these values
# into the workflow_dispatch defaults (so they show pre-filled in the "Run
# workflow" UI) and commit the change. `make collect` also reads this file for
# local runs; explicit environment variables override it.

